@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-vn27-fund-art18-22`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Chapter V (Organisation of implementation), Articles 61 to 74: the
-- duties of ministries, provincial committees and associations. Article 75, the insurers'
-- duties, is the next module. Of Articles 61-74 only Article 62(5) gives a period on which a
-- motor claim depends (the police documents of Article 13(5)); it is encoded. Articles 62, 65
-- and 73 were read in full for anything else that bears on the motor provisions; what was
-- found is recorded below and in NOTES.md §2. Every other Article is recorded there as out of
-- scope, with its reason.
-- DECREE 220/2026 amends Article 63 (construction: "hoạt động đầu tư xây dựng" becomes "hoạt
-- động xây dựng", Decree 220 Article 9(2)); nothing else in Articles 61-74.

§ `Chapter V — organisation of implementation (Articles 61 to 74)`

-- src:1779 | Chương V
-- src:1780 | TỔ CHỨC THỰC HIỆN

§§ `Article 61 — the Ministry of Finance`

-- Out of scope: propaganda, supervising the Fund (2), inspecting the insurers (3), sanctioning
-- them (4), and setting up the national body for the ASEAN Protocol 5 (5). These are the
-- Ministry's powers as regulator; none gives a policyholder, a person harmed or an insurer a
-- right that this decree makes enforceable against the Ministry.
-- src:1782 | Điều 61. Trách nhiệm của Bộ Tài chính

§§ `Article 62 — the Ministry of Public Security`

-- Read in full. (1) propaganda; (2) inspecting and sanctioning breaches of the compulsory motor
-- insurance; (3)-(4), (7) fire insurance; (6) sharing police data into the database of the
-- compulsory motor insurance. Out of scope: none of these gives a period or a right on which a
-- motor claim turns.
-- (5) is encoded: the Ministry directs the traffic police and the investigating police to
-- provide copies of the documents of Article 13(5) (the police notice of the result of the
-- investigation of the accident, or of its conclusion) within 5 working days of the day there
-- is an investigation result. Article 13, last paragraph, makes those documents the insurer's
-- to gather, and Article 75(9) makes the insurer pay for the copies.
-- Fork V20: the duty is written as the Ministry's (to direct); the encoding binds the police
--   it directs, who are the ones who can provide. The recipient is not named; it is taken to
--   be the insurer, who gathers those documents. The clock runs from "ngày có kết quả điều
--   tra" (the day there is an investigation result), which no text in the sources times
--   (finding R11).
-- THE CLOCK of the regulative rule is working days from the day of the investigation result
-- (fork V5); the date function gives the calendar day.
-- src:1796 | Điều 62. Trách nhiệm của Bộ Công an
