§§ `Articles 66 to 72 — other ministries, provinces and bodies`

-- Out of scope: propaganda (66, 67, 68(2), 70(1), 72), coordination (67, 69(1), 70(2), 71),
-- provincial enforcement against owners who do not buy the insurance (68(3)) and border checks
-- on vehicles in transit (69(2)). Articles 68(3) and 69(2) are enforcement of the owner's duty
-- to buy the insurance (Article 4(1), row VN-10); they set no sanction of their own. Article
-- 70(2) has the National Traffic Safety Committee coordinate with the Fund on humanitarian
-- support; it adds nothing to who is paid.
